**Fix: key each row by the item's stable identity, not its index.**

```dart
ReorderableListView.builder(
  itemCount: items.length,
  onReorder: onReorder,
  itemBuilder: (context, index) {
    final item = items[index];
    return TodoTile(
      key: ValueKey(item.id), // stable, unique per item; never index or a random value
      item: item,
    );
  },
)
```

